[INFO] Step 1. Expert Recruitment
Agent 1 (👨🏽‍⚕️ Infectious Disease Specialist): Specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of infections caused by bacteria, viruses, fungi, and parasites.
Agent 2 (👩🏼‍⚕️ Rheumatologist): Focuses on the diagnosis and treatment of musculoskeletal disease and systemic autoimmune conditions.
Agent 3 (🧑🏿‍⚕️ Travel Medicine Specialist): Specializes in the health of travelers, including pre-travel advice and post-travel evaluation of illnesses.

