**(E) Contralateral loss of vibration and proprioception**
- **Incorrect.** Vibration and proprioception are carried in the **dorsal columns**, which ascend **ipsilaterally** until they decussate in the medulla. A C5 lesion would cause **ipsilateral** (left) loss, not contralateral.

