 Agent 3 (👨🏽‍⚕️ geriatric psychiatrist) : The symptoms described in this 61-year-old man—**unusual smacking motion with his lips, pursing of the mouth, and blinking excessively**—are highly suggestive of **tardive dyskinesia (TD)**. Here’s why the other options are less likely:

