- **(B) & (C) Three weekly injections of penicillin** → **Inappropriate without LP** (risk of untreated neurosyphilis).
- **(D) Single injection of penicillin** → **Insufficient for syphilis in HIV+ patients** (higher risk of treatment failure).
- **(E) Single injection + titers in 6 months** → **Inadequate treatment duration** (HIV+ patients may need longer therapy).

