oring** is critical to detect **persistent gestational trophoblastic disease (GTD)** or **choriocarcinoma**.\n   - **Contraception counseling** is necessary to prevent pregnancy for **6–12 months** due to recurrence risk.\n\n#### **Conclusion:**\nThe **genotype of the aspirated tissue in this case of a complete hydatidiform mole is most likely 46,XX**.\n\n**Final Answer: (E) 46XX** ✅'}

