lusion:**\nThe **multidisciplinary team’s reasoning is robust and consistent**, with **no dissenting opinions** on the primary diagnosis or the future risk of **non-Hodgkin lymphoma (Option B)**. The other options lack evidence-based support in the context of Sjögren’s syndrome.\n\n**Final Answer: (B) Non-Hodgkin lymphoma**'}

